<title>USA: Spectrum Signal to buy back shrs.</title>
<headline>Spectrum Signal to buy back shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spectrum Signal Processing Inc said Friday it plans to buy back up to 460,000 shares, or 4.97 percent of its total outstanding.</p>
<p>Spectrum Signal, which supplies digital signal processing system solutions, has about 9.248 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
